= SPD Declines to Seek the Minister-Presidency

We have chosen not to seek election as Minister-President at this time.

**Consequences:**
- The initiative will pass to the next largest party
- Our reputation for governmental responsibility in the largest German state may suffer
- Some within the party question this decision

**The Landtag will now turn to the next party in line.**

- @coalition_failure_prussia: Continue

# ============================================
# PLAYER REVIEWS COALITION INVITATION (NON-FORMATEUR, PRUSSIA)
# ============================================

@player_coalition_review_prussia
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.coalition_formed_prussia) {
    var seat_total = 0;
for (var i = 0; i < Q.parties.length; i++) {
    seat_total += Q[Q.parties[i] + '_seats_prussia'] || 0;
}
if (seat_total === 0) seat_total = 1;

Q.coalition_partners_list_prussia = "";
for (var i = 0; i < Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.parties.length; i++) {
    var party = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.parties[i];
    var seat_pct = ((Q[party.toLowerCase() + '_seats_prussia'] || 0) / seat_total) * 100;
    Q.coalition_partners_list_prussia += "- " + party + " (" + Math.round(seat_pct * 10) / 10 + "%)\n";
}
    Q.coalition_total_votes_prussia = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.votes;
    Q.coalition_is_minority_prussia = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.toleration ? 1 : 0;
    Q.coalition_toleration_display_prussia = "";
    if (Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.toleration) {
        Q.coalition_toleration_display_prussia = "\n**External Toleration (not in cabinet):**\n";
        var tols = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.tolerating_parties;
        for (var i = 0; i < tols.length; i++) {
    var tpct = ((Q[tols[i].toLowerCase() + '_seats_prussia'] || 0) / seat_total) * 100;
    Q.coalition_toleration_display_prussia += "- " + tols[i] + " (" + Math.round(tpct * 10) / 10 + "%) — tolerating\n";
        }
        Q.coalition_effective_votes_prussia = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.effective_votes;
    }
}
!}

= Coalition Invitation - [+ formateur_prussia +] Proposes State Government

**[+ formateur_prussia +] has successfully negotiated a coalition and invites the SPD to participate in the Prussian state government.**

**Proposed Coalition:**

[+ coalition_partners_list_prussia +]

**Total Landtag Support:** [+ coalition_total_votes_prussia +]%

[? if coalition_is_minority_prussia : This is a **minority government** that will rely on external toleration to survive votes of no confidence. ?]

[+ coalition_toleration_display_prussia +]

[? if coalition_is_minority_prussia : **Effective majority with tolerating parties:** [+ coalition_effective_votes_prussia +]% ?]

**Minister-President:** [+ formateur_prussia +] will provide the Minister-President.

**What is our decision?**

- @accept_coalition_invitation_prussia: Accept the invitation and join this coalition
- @reject_coalition_invitation_prussia: Decline the invitation

@accept_coalition_invitation_prussia
on-arrival: spd_accepted_coalition_prussia = 1

We accept the invitation to join this state government.

- @coalition_success_prussia: Alright.

@reject_coalition_invitation_prussia

= Declining Coalition Participation

**Are you certain you want to decline this coalition?**

**Consequences:**
- [+ formateur_prussia +] will attempt to form a government without the SPD
- We will sit in opposition in the Landtag
- Relations with [+ formateur_prussia +] will worsen
- The coalition may lack a majority and fail

- @confirm_reject_coalition_prussia: Yes, decline the invitation
- @accept_coalition_invitation_prussia: No, accept the coalition after all

@confirm_reject_coalition_prussia
on-arrival: {!
var formateur_lower = Q.formateur_prussia.toLowerCase();
var relation_var = formateur_lower + '_relation';
if (Q[relation_var] !== undefined) {
    Q[relation_var] -= 4;
}

Q.spd_rejection_count_prussia = (Q.spd_rejection_count_prussia || 0) + 1;

if (!Q.rejected_coalitions_prussia) Q.rejected_coalitions_prussia = [];
Q.rejected_coalitions_prussia.push(JSON.stringify(Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.parties.slice().sort()));

Q.next_coalition_found_prussia = 0;
for (var i = 0; i < Q.possible_coalitions_prussia.length; i++) {
    var coal = Q.possible_coalitions_prussia[i];
    var key = JSON.stringify(coal.parties.slice().sort());
    var already_rejected = false;
    for (var j = 0; j < Q.rejected_coalitions_prussia.length; j++) {
        if (Q.rejected_coalitions_prussia[j] === key) { already_rejected = true; break; }
    }
    if (!already_rejected && coal.parties.indexOf('SPD') >= 0) {
        Q.chosen_coalition_prussia = coal;
        Q.next_coalition_found_prussia = 1;
        break;
    }
}

Q.spd_accepted_coalition_prussia = 0;
Q.spd_in_chosen_coalition_prussia = Q.next_coalition_found_prussia;
!}
go-to: player_coalition_review_prussia if next_coalition_found_prussia and spd_rejection_count_prussia < 3; coalition_failure_prussia if not next_coalition_found_prussia or spd_rejection_count_prussia >= 3

@coalition_formed_without_spd_prussia

= State Government Formed Without SPD

**[+ formateur_prussia +] has formed a state government without the SPD.**

**Coalition Partners:**

[+ coalition_partners_list_prussia +]

**Total Support:** [+ coalition_total_votes_prussia +]%

The SPD will sit in opposition in the Landtag. [? if coalition_total_votes_prussia < 55 : This is a narrow majority and may prove unstable. ?]

- @continue_without_spd_prussia: Continue

@continue_without_spd_prussia
on-arrival: {!
Q.spd_in_government_prussia = 0;
Q.in_weimar_coalition_prussia = 0;
Q.in_grand_coalition_prussia = 0;
Q.in_left_front_prussia = 0;
Q.in_popular_front_prussia = 0;

Q.workers_spd += 2;
Q.left_strength += 3;
!}
go-to: coalition_success_prussia






@coalition_success_prussia
on-arrival: {!
// ============================================
// COALITION SUCCESSFULLY FORMED (PRUSSIA)
// ============================================

Q.is_minority_government_prussia = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.toleration ? 1 : 0;
Q.tolerating_parties_prussia = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.toleration ? Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.tolerating_parties : [];
Q.spd_toleration_prussia = (Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.toleration && Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.tolerating_parties.indexOf('SPD') >= 0) ? 1 : 0;

if (Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.toleration) {
    for (var i = 0; i < Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.tolerating_parties.length; i++) {
        var t = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.tolerating_parties[i].toLowerCase();
        Q[t + '_tolerating_prussia'] = 1;
    }
}

var coalition = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.parties;
Q.government_parties_prussia = coalition;
Q.coalition_votes_prussia = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.votes;
Q.coalition_type_prussia = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.type;

var seat_total_cs = 0;
for (var i = 0; i < Q.parties.length; i++) {
    seat_total_cs += Q[Q.parties[i] + '_seats_prussia'] || 0;
}
if (seat_total_cs === 0) seat_total_cs = 1;

Q.coalition_partners_list_prussia = "";
for (var i = 0; i < coalition.length; i++) {
    var party = coalition[i];
    var seat_pct = ((Q[party.toLowerCase() + '_seats_prussia'] || 0) / seat_total_cs) * 100;
    Q.coalition_partners_list_prussia += "- **" + party + "**: " + Math.round(seat_pct * 10) / 10 + "%\n";
}

if (Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.toleration) {
    Q.coalition_partners_list_prussia += "\n**External Support (Toleration):**\n";
    var tol_parties = Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.tolerating_parties;
    for (var i = 0; i < tol_parties.length; i++) {
        var tparty = tol_parties[i];
        var tpct = ((Q[tparty.toLowerCase() + '_seats_prussia'] || 0) / seat_total_cs) * 100;
        Q.coalition_partners_list_prussia += "- **" + tparty + "**: " + Math.round(tpct * 10) / 10 + "% *(tolerating)*\n";
    }
    Q.coalition_votes_display_prussia = Math.round(Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.votes * 10) / 10 + "% (effective: " + Math.round(Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.effective_votes * 10) / 10 + "%)";
} else {
    Q.coalition_votes_display_prussia = Math.round(Q.chosen_coalition_prussia.votes * 10) / 10 + "%";
}

// ============================================
// SET COALITION NAME AND FLAGS
// ============================================

if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'weimar') {
    Q.in_weimar_coalition_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Weimar Coalition";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'grand' || Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'grand_small') {
    Q.in_grand_coalition_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Grand Coalition";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'social_christian') {
    Q.in_social_christian_coalition_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Social - Christian Coalition";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'social_liberal') {
    Q.in_social_liberal_coalition_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Social - Liberal Coalition";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'left_front') {
    Q.in_left_front_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Left Front";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'popular_front') {
    Q.in_popular_front_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Popular Front";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'socialist_unity') {
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Socialist Unity Coalition";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'bourgeois' || Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'bourgeois_catholic') {
    Q.in_bourgeois_coalition_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Bourgeois Coalition";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'right' || Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'right_business') {
    Q.in_right_coalition_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Right Coalition";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'far_right') {
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Far-Right Coalition";
} else if (Q.coalition_type_prussia === 'unity') {
    Q.in_unity_government_prussia = 1;
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Unity Government";
} else {
    Q.coalition_name_prussia = "Coalition Government";
}

// ============================================
// IDENTIFY MINISTER-PRESIDENT CANDIDATES
// ============================================

function get_mp_candidates_for_party_prussia(party) {
    var candidates = [];

    if (party === 'KPD') {
        if (Q.kpd_party_leader === "Conciliators") {
            candidates.push({name: "Neumann", weight: 100});
        } else {
            candidates.push({name: "Thälmann", weight: 100});
        }
    }
    else if (party === 'SAPD') {
        candidates.push({name: "Rosenfeld", weight: 100});
    }
    else if (party === 'SPD') {
        if (Q.spd_mp_preference_prussia === "braun") {
            candidates.push({name: "Braun", weight: 100});
        } else if (Q.spd_mp_preference_prussia === "hirsch") {
            candidates.push({name: "Hirsch", weight: 100});
        } else if (Q.spd_mp_preference_prussia === "severing") {
            candidates.push({name: "Severing", weight: 100});
        } else if (Q.spd_mp_preference_prussia === "heilmann") {
            candidates.push({name: "Heilmann", weight: 100});
        } else if (Q.spd_mp_preference_prussia === "grzesinski") {
            candidates.push({name: "Grzesinski", weight: 100});
        } else if (Q.spd_mp_preference_prussia === "mr_monopoly") {
            candidates.push({name: "Rich Uncle Pennybags", weight: 200});
        } else {
            candidates.push({name: "Braun", weight: 100});
        }
    }
    else if (party === 'SRPD') {
        candidates.push({name: "Hörsing", weight: 100});
    }
    else if (party === 'DDP') {
        candidates.push({name: "Höpker-Aschoff", weight: 100});
        if (Q.ddp_votes_prussia < 3) {
            candidates.push({name: "Nuschke", weight: 80});
        }
        if (Q.ddp_name === "DStP") {
            candidates.push({name: "Schreiber", weight: 90});
        }
    }
    else if (party === 'Z') {
        if (Q.z_party_leader === "Joos") {
            candidates.push({name: "Hess", weight: 100});
            candidates.push({name: "Hirtsiefer", weight: 100});
            candidates.push({name: "Joos", weight: 80});
        } else if (Q.z_party_leader === "Kaas") {
            candidates.push({name: "Kaas", weight: 90});
            candidates.push({name: "Hirtsiefer", weight: 100});
        } else if (Q.z_party_leader === "Brüning") {
            candidates.push({name: "Brüning", weight: 70});
            candidates.push({name: "Hirtsiefer", weight: 100});
        } else {
            candidates.push({name: "Hess", weight: 100});
            candidates.push({name: "Hirtsiefer", weight: 100});
            candidates.push({name: "Porsch", weight: 60});
        }
    }
    else if (party === 'BVP') {
        candidates.push({name: "Schmelzer", weight: 60});
    }
    else if (party === 'DVP') {
        candidates.push({name: "Boelitz", weight: 100});
        candidates.push({name: "Kanitz", weight: 70});
    }
    else if (party === 'WP') {
        candidates.push({name: "Drewitz", weight: 90});
    }
    else if (party === 'CSVD') {
        candidates.push({name: "Lambach", weight: 90});
    }
    else if (party === 'CNBL') {
        candidates.push({name: "Kriege", weight: 70});
    }
    else if (party === 'DNVP') {
        if (Q.dnvp_line === 3) {
            candidates.push({name: "Hugenberg", weight: 100});
        } else if (Q.dnvp_line === 2) {
            candidates.push({name: "Westarp", weight: 100});
        } else {
            candidates.push({name: "Winterfeld", weight: 70});
        }
    } else if (party === 'DVFP') {
        candidates.push({name: "Graefe", weight: 55});
        candidates.push({name: "Ludendorff", weight: 25});
        candidates.push({name: "Reventlow", weight: 10});
    }

    return candidates;
}

var all_candidates = [];

for (var i = 0; i < coalition.length; i++) {
    var party = coalition[i];
    var votes = Q[party.toLowerCase() + '_r_prussia'];
    var party_candidates = get_mp_candidates_for_party_prussia(party);

    for (var j = 0; j < party_candidates.length; j++) {
        var candidate = party_candidates[j];
        all_candidates.push({
            party: party,
            name: candidate.name,
            votes: votes,
            weight: candidate.weight,
            score: votes * (candidate.weight / 100)

        });
    }
}

all_candidates.sort(function(a, b) { return b.score - a.score; });

Q.mp_candidates_prussia = [];
Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia = "";

var num_candidates = Math.min(20, all_candidates.length);
for (var i = 0; i < num_candidates; i++) {
    var candidate = all_candidates[i];

    Q.mp_candidates_prussia.push({
        party: candidate.party,
        name: candidate.name,
        votes: candidate.votes,
        weight: candidate.weight
    });

    Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia += (i + 1) + ". **" + candidate.name + "** (" + candidate.party + ", " + Math.round(candidate.votes * 10) / 10 + "%)";

    if (candidate.name === "Braun") {
        Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia += " - Incumbent Minister-President";
    } else if (candidate.name === "Hirsch") {
        Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia += " - Former Minister-President";
    } else if (candidate.name === "Severing") {
        Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia += " - Interior Ministry Veteran";
    } else if (candidate.name === "Grzesinski") {
        Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia += " - Berlin Police President";
    } else if (candidate.name === "Höpker-Aschoff") {
        Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia += " - Finance Expert";
    } else if (candidate.name === "Hirtsiefer") {
        Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia += " - Welfare Minister";
    }

    Q.mp_candidates_display_prussia += "\n";
}

Q.num_candidates_prussia = Q.mp_candidates_prussia.length;

for (var i = 0; i < Q.num_candidates_prussia && i < 20; i++) {
    Q['candidate_prussia_' + i + '_name'] = Q.mp_candidates_prussia[i].name;
    Q['candidate_prussia_' + i + '_party'] = Q.mp_candidates_prussia[i].party;
}

// ============================================
// SET COALITION FLAGS
// ============================================

var lowercase_coalition = coalition.map(function(p) { return p.toLowerCase(); });

for (var party of Q.parties) {
    Q[party + '_in_government_prussia'] = lowercase_coalition.indexOf(party) >= 0 ? 1 : 0;
}


!}
go-to: mp_negotiation_spd_prussia if spd_in_government_prussia; mp_negotiation_ai_prussia if not spd_in_government_prussia

