- **Kultus (Welfare, Church & Education):** [+ kultus_minister_party_prussia +] - [+ kultus_minister_prussia +]

*(Note: unlike the Reich government, the Prussian Staatsministerium has no Foreign Ministry or Reichswehr Ministry — foreign policy and the military are Reich-level competences.)*

