@ministry_renegotiation_prussia
view-if: spd_in_government_prussia >= 1
title: Prussian Ministry Reshuffle
subtitle: Reallocate Staatsministerium positions within the current coalition

**Current Coalition:** [+ coalition_name_prussia +]

**Current Ministry Allocation:**

[+ ministry_display_list_prussia +]

The current distribution reflects the balance of power when the coalition was formed. We can attempt to renegotiate ministry positions, but this may strain coalition relations.

- @begin_ministry_shuffle_prussia: Begin ministry shuffle
- @cancel_shuffle_prussia: Keep current arrangement

@begin_ministry_shuffle_prussia
on-arrival: {!
Q.original_allocation_prussia = {
    interior: Q.interior_minister_party_prussia,
    justice: Q.justice_minister_party_prussia,
    finance: Q.finance_minister_party_prussia,
    trade: Q.trade_minister_party_prussia,
    agriculture: Q.agriculture_minister_party_prussia,
    publicworks: Q.publicworks_minister_party_prussia,
    kultus: Q.kultus_minister_party_prussia
};

var coalition = Q.government_parties_prussia;
var total_coalition_votes = 0;

for (var i = 0; i < coalition.length; i++) {
    var party = coalition[i];
    var party_lower = party.toLowerCase();
    total_coalition_votes += Q[party_lower + '_r_prussia'];
}

if (total_coalition_votes === 0 || isNaN(total_coalition_votes)) {
    total_coalition_votes = 1;
}

Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia = {};

for (var i = 0; i < coalition.length; i++) {
    var party = coalition[i];
    var party_lower = party.toLowerCase();

    var base = (Q[party_lower + '_r_prussia'] / total_coalition_votes) * 100;

    var relation_var = party_lower + '_relation';
    var relation = Q[relation_var] || 50;
    base += (relation - 50) / 5;

    if (Q.mp_party_prussia === party) {
        base += 10;
    }

    if (party === 'SPD') {
        if (Q.coalition_tension > 3) base -= 5;
    }

    Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia[party] = Math.max(base, 5);
}

var ministry_costs = {
    interior: 12,
    justice: 10,
    finance: 15,
    trade: 12,
    agriculture: 8,
    publicworks: 8,
    kultus: 10
};

for (var ministry in ministry_costs) {
    if (!ministry_costs.hasOwnProperty(ministry)) continue;

    var party_var = ministry + '_minister_party_prussia';
    var holding_party = Q[party_var];

    if (holding_party && Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia[holding_party] !== undefined) {
        Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia[holding_party] -= ministry_costs[ministry];
    }
}

for (var party in Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia) {
    if (!Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia.hasOwnProperty(party)) continue;
    Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia[party] = Math.max(0, Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia[party]);
}

Q.shuffle_spd_variable_prussia = Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia.SPD || 0;

Q.shuffle_leverage_display_prussia = "";
for (var party in Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia) {
    if (!Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia.hasOwnProperty(party)) continue;
    var rounded = Math.round(Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia[party] * 10) / 10;
    Q.shuffle_leverage_display_prussia += "- **" + party + "**: " + rounded + " leverage\n";
}
!}

**Updated Leverage:**

[+ shuffle_leverage_display_prussia +]

- @ministry_picker_prussia: Proceed with reshuffle
- @cancel_shuffle_prussia: Cancel

@ministry_picker_prussia
tags: ministry_shuffle_root_prussia

We can now attempt to claim or drop Prussian ministries. Each change costs or returns leverage based on ministry importance.

**Current SPD Ministries:**
[? if interior_minister_party_prussia = "SPD" : Interior (cost: 12) ?]
[? if justice_minister_party_prussia = "SPD" : Justice (cost: 10) ?]
[? if finance_minister_party_prussia = "SPD" : Finance (cost: 15) ?]
[? if trade_minister_party_prussia = "SPD" : Trade & Commerce (cost: 12) ?]
[? if agriculture_minister_party_prussia = "SPD" : Agriculture (cost: 8) ?]
[? if publicworks_minister_party_prussia = "SPD" : Public Works (cost: 8) ?]
[? if kultus_minister_party_prussia = "SPD" : Kultus (cost: 10) ?]

**Available Leverage:** [+ shuffle_spd_variable_prussia +]

- @claim_interior_prussia: Claim Interior Ministry (cost: 12)
- @claim_justice_prussia: Claim Justice Ministry (cost: 10)
- @claim_finance_prussia: Claim Finance Ministry (cost: 15)
- @claim_trade_prussia: Claim Trade & Commerce Ministry (cost: 12)
- @claim_agriculture_prussia: Claim Agriculture Ministry (cost: 8)
- @claim_publicworks_prussia: Claim Public Works Ministry (cost: 8)
- @claim_kultus_prussia: Claim Kultus Ministry (cost: 10)
- @drop_interior_prussia: Drop Interior Ministry (gain: 12)
- @drop_justice_prussia: Drop Justice Ministry (gain: 10)
- @drop_finance_prussia: Drop Finance Ministry (gain: 15)
- @drop_trade_prussia: Drop Trade & Commerce Ministry (gain: 12)
- @drop_agriculture_prussia: Drop Agriculture Ministry (gain: 8)
- @drop_publicworks_prussia: Drop Public Works Ministry (gain: 8)
- @drop_kultus_prussia: Drop Kultus Ministry (gain: 10)
- @finalize_shuffle_prussia: Finalize reshuffle

@claim_interior_prussia
title: Claim Interior Ministry
unavailable-subtitle: [? if interior_minister_party_prussia = "SPD" : Already controlled ?][? if shuffle_spd_variable_prussia < 12 : Not enough leverage ?]
choose-if: interior_minister_party_prussia != "SPD" and shuffle_spd_variable_prussia >= 12
on-arrival: {!
    Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia.SPD -= 12;
    Q.shuffle_spd_variable_prussia = Q.shuffle_leverage_prussia.SPD;
    Q.previous_interior_party_prussia = Q.interior_minister_party_prussia;
    Q.interior_minister_party_prussia = "SPD";
    Q.interior_minister_prussia = "Severing";

    if (Q.previous_interior_party_prussia && Q.previous_interior_party_prussia !== 'I') {
        var rel_var = Q.previous_interior_party_prussia.toLowerCase() + '_relation';
        Q[rel_var] = Math.max(0, (Q[rel_var] || 50) - 8);
    }
!}
